0..79 Comment "// A view of a value held inside a scope, kept at the scope around its hold, as"
80..159 Comment "// Rust refuses a reference to a block\'s local that outlives the block: `let r;"
160..239 Comment "// { let x = 42; r = &x; } *r` (E0597, `x` does not live long enough). A shared"
240..319 Comment "// view kept in a region keeps its held value frozen until the region ends, and"
320..381 Comment "// a hold opened inside the scope ends before the scope does."
382..384 Comment "//"
385..441 Comment "// - see: #1494 — `keptPastHold`, `keptPastNestedHold`"
443..474 Comment "// Early exit\'s host interface."
